{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to plants with prior OAI classifications and the shortage has been listed for 49 months",
  "headline_cites": ["E12", "E14", "E16", "E25", "E31", "D11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows etomidate injection has been in shortage since 2022-10-05 across multiple manufacturers including Caplin Steriles, Eugia US LLC, Gland Pharma, Hikma Pharmaceuticals, Hospira, and Mylan Institutional.",
      "cites": ["E33", "E34", "E35", "E36", "E37", "E38"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 49 months.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira's plant (FEI 1021343) received OAI classifications in 2010-01-19, 2011-06-17, and 2011-08-04, with a Warning Letter issued 2010-04-12.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E14", "E16", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma Farmaceutica Portugal (FEI 3002807173) received an OAI classification on 2014-03-28 and a Warning Letter on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E25", "E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Recent inspections at both plants were classified VAI: Hospira on 2025-02-07 and Hikma Portugal on 2023-04-21.",
      "cites": ["E22", "E32"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to transfer 34 units from Corvale Lakeside (22 days on hand) to Corvale East (7.6 days on hand, would reach 9 days).",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An approved therapeutic interchange exists for the same product from Civica, Inc. (NDC 72572016010) as an alternate manufacturer, approved 2025-11-20.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E41"]
    }
  ]
}
